<title>POLAND: KRUSZWICA SWINGS TO PLN 3.4 MLN LOSS JUNE.</title>
<headline>KRUSZWICA SWINGS TO PLN 3.4 MLN LOSS JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 3.39 vs   0.37 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   3.65 vs   0.53</p>
<p> Operating loss	 2.01 vs   0.13</p>
<p> Sales		   27.44 vs  29.90</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 3.75 vs   8.02</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   2.96 vs  16.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.44 vs  25.08</p>
<p> Sales		  226.97 vs 237.94</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish edible fats producer is Zaklady</p>
<p>Tluszczowe Kruszwica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
